    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/f07e769ea379aac101cb595f8a3ee25f.avif?t=1704136835\" width=572 height=88 /></span><br>Different kinds of dice enemies come one after the other. You take on the role of a rolling dice that keeps bouncing up and down to crush your enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting game groove</h2>Varied enemies and barrier will restrict your movement range greatly. It's time to show off your handling skills to flatten more enemy in limit time or undless wave.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.poster.avif?t=1704136835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.webm?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.mp4?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Items selection</h2>Earn points by defeating enemies and exchange them for powerful props: Invincibility, Instant Kill, Time Stop ect... You can always find your favorite props to take the lead in the dice battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.poster.avif?t=1704136835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.webm?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.mp4?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select mode&amp;difficulty</h2>Story mode and endless now available on easy&amp;hard difficulty. Play in suitable field to practice your skills. Reach higher and have the last laugh.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules that needed to be known</h2>\ud83c\udfb2 Players need to continuously eliminate enemies on the field to reach higher levels or scores.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 The Dice's HP point is displayed in the upper left corner of the interface. One HP point will be deducted when the dice touches an enemy or an enemy bullet.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 The dice has 3 life points by default. You'll lose the game round when this point is reduced to 0.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 Be sure to bring items before starting the game. Equip the item to help you win the game more easily. ( The item would only be consumed if it's used during a round )",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/f07e769ea379aac101cb595f8a3ee25f.avif?t=1704136835\" width=572 height=88 /></span><br>Different kinds of dice enemies come one after the other. You take on the role of a rolling dice that keeps bouncing up and down to crush your enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting game groove</h2>Varied enemies and barrier will restrict your movement range greatly. It's time to show off your handling skills to flatten more enemy in limit time or undless wave.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.poster.avif?t=1704136835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.webm?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/58574e2ef2b538ad20da3c3f8add62d5.mp4?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Items selection</h2>Earn points by defeating enemies and exchange them for powerful props: Invincibility, Instant Kill, Time Stop ect... You can always find your favorite props to take the lead in the dice battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.poster.avif?t=1704136835\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.webm?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685170/extras/d68e95e58fad24a7b6df3982e275f740.mp4?t=1704136835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select mode&amp;difficulty</h2>Story mode and endless now available on easy&amp;hard difficulty. Play in suitable field to practice your skills. Reach higher and have the last laugh.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules that needed to be known</h2>\ud83c\udfb2 Players need to continuously eliminate enemies on the field to reach higher levels or scores.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 The Dice's HP point is displayed in the upper left corner of the interface. One HP point will be deducted when the dice touches an enemy or an enemy bullet.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 The dice has 3 life points by default. You'll lose the game round when this point is reduced to 0.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 Be sure to bring items before starting the game. Equip the item to help you win the game more easily. ( The item would only be consumed if it's used during a round )",
    "short_description": "Dice Battle is a casual game in which you can jump over your enemies as a rolling dice and flatten them in level or endless mode. Control your dice properly to dodge the barrage and defeat your opponent's dice.",
